WEBVTT

00:05.580 --> 00:07.790
<b>Ooh, it's cold!</b>

00:08.170 --> 00:10.170
<b>It's gotten really cold lately.</b>

00:10.170 --> 00:12.250
<b>Wanna go eat something warm?</b>

00:12.250 --> 00:16.290
<b>Oh, but I need to go to Hero Club...</b>

00:16.580 --> 00:20.290
<b>You've been pretty busy since the festival, huh?</b>

00:20.460 --> 00:23.540
<b>Yeah. All kinds of clubs keep asking us for help.</b>

00:24.460 --> 00:28.580
<b>Oh yeah! I heard that the Drama Club
got some new members.</b>

00:29.460 --> 00:34.630
<b>They did! They got us some of Satou's
milk strawberry jelly yokan to thank us,</b>

00:35.040 --> 00:37.130
<b>so come have some too, Nanako-chan!</b>

00:37.420 --> 00:38.540
<b>Can I?!</b>

00:38.540 --> 00:39.630
<b>Of course!</b>

00:42.420 --> 00:46.460
<b>Mizuki Hijiri-san, please report
to the Student Council Room immediately.</b>

00:47.290 --> 00:53.040
<b>I repeat. Mizuki Hijiri-san, please report
to the Student Council Room immediately.</b>

00:48.290 --> 00:49.750
<b>I wonder what they want?</b>

00:50.830 --> 00:53.040
<b>N-no idea...</b>

01:09.330 --> 01:11.710
<b>Sousa ore wa mezamete shimatta</b>

01:11.710 --> 01:14.540
<b>Tokubetsu na chikara motte shimatta</b>

01:14.540 --> 01:16.710
<b>Kono barrier no maeni wa</b>

01:16.710 --> 01:21.170
<b>Donna yatsura mo muryoku daze</b>

01:24.250 --> 01:26.960
<b>Tenshi ka akuma no umarekawari ka</b>

01:26.960 --> 01:29.750
<b>Mienai mono ga miete shimaunda</b>

01:29.750 --> 01:31.960
<b>Migiude ga uzukidashita</b>

01:31.960 --> 01:34.330
<b>Kakusei no toki wa mada hayai</b>

01:34.460 --> 01:37.130
<b>Kodomo janaisi otona demo nai</b>

01:37.130 --> 01:39.460
<b>Tetsugaku pierce buchi akete</b>

01:39.460 --> 01:43.250
<b>Kashiore karaage lemon o kaketara saa!</b>

01:43.540 --> 01:45.880
<b>(Nonde nonde nonde nonde)</b>

01:46.040 --> 01:48.380
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:48.380 --> 01:50.880
<b>Kodoku to herikutsu no yami ni magirete</b>

01:50.880 --> 01:53.460
<b>Tokkouyaku wa mitsukaranai</b>

01:53.460 --> 01:55.830
<b>Otoko ni umareta shukumei dakara</b>

01:55.830 --> 01:58.630
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

01:58.630 --> 02:01.130
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:01.130 --> 02:03.540
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

02:03.540 --> 02:06.000
<b>Risou to genjitsu no hazama de yureteru</b>

02:06.000 --> 02:08.580
<b>Kaiketsusaku wa miataranai</b>

02:08.580 --> 02:11.130
<b>Setsuna o musaboru unmei naraba</b>

02:11.130 --> 02:13.750
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

02:13.920 --> 02:16.250
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:16.250 --> 02:18.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:25.750
<b>New Dictionary</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:25.750
<b>Third Edition</b>

02:24.710 --> 02:27.710
<b>Episode 10</b>

02:24.710 --> 02:27.710
<b>Mingled in the Darkness of Solitude and Twisted Logic</b>

02:30.500 --> 02:32.830
<b>I'm pretty sure we didn't cause any trouble.</b>

02:33.080 --> 02:35.960
<b>You're the only one who feels that way.</b>

02:37.250 --> 02:39.130
<b>Have a look at these photos.</b>

02:41.790 --> 02:43.960
<b>Can you tell us who this is?</b>

02:46.880 --> 02:49.920
<b>Kirito Setsuna, but...</b>

02:50.580 --> 02:53.080
<b>Who is he and where is he from?</b>

02:53.710 --> 02:54.540
<b>Huh?</b>

02:55.500 --> 03:00.040
<b>Don't tell us you let a total stranger onstage
without getting permission first?</b>

03:01.170 --> 03:04.290
<b>No, it's not like that...</b>

03:04.750 --> 03:08.880
<b>But I promised Mikuriya-kun that
I'd keep Kirito's identity a secret.</b>

03:09.420 --> 03:14.670
<b>If you let some unidentified individual get involved
in a school event, that's a huge problem.</b>

03:14.670 --> 03:19.040
<b>Parents have voiced concerns over how
the school handles people from outside.</b>

03:19.290 --> 03:20.830
<b>But everyone loved it!</b>

03:21.420 --> 03:23.790
<b>The students did, perhaps.</b>

03:24.210 --> 03:26.250
<b>It all piles up.</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:31.920
<b>And that leads to the constant problems and complaints.</b>

03:34.790 --> 03:38.670
<b>I hate to say this, but we're at the end of our rope.</b>

03:40.210 --> 03:43.500
<b>The Hero Club is hereby disbanded.</b>

03:44.210 --> 03:48.040
<b>But it's not even a proper club!
How can it be disbanded?!</b>

03:48.670 --> 03:53.330
<b>There's one clear violation that
you Hero Club members are making.</b>

03:53.960 --> 03:54.920
<b>What's that?</b>

03:56.330 --> 03:59.420
<b>Illegitimate use of school property.</b>

04:02.500 --> 04:06.420
<b>What do you think you're doing to our clubroom?!</b>

04:03.170 --> 04:04.670
<b>Precious Memories</b>

04:03.170 --> 04:04.670
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

04:08.040 --> 04:10.330
<b>Stop that!</b>

04:10.830 --> 04:13.750
<b>Your little hero games are over.</b>

04:14.130 --> 04:18.710
<b>We need this place to be the true heroes that we are!</b>

04:19.210 --> 04:23.920
<b>Me, Yellow, Purple, Pink, Green, and Black!</b>

04:23.920 --> 04:26.040
<b>Our six powers unite...</b>

04:26.170 --> 04:27.790
<b>in this haven of energy!</b>

04:28.170 --> 04:29.420
<b>N-no!</b>

04:30.290 --> 04:32.540
<b>Don't abuse Sora-chan like that!</b>

04:33.000 --> 04:35.080
<b>This place is off limits.</b>

04:35.790 --> 04:40.710
<b>Just because you're helping people out doesn't
mean you can ignore the rules.</b>

04:41.170 --> 04:45.040
<b>How can you call yourself heroes when
you can't even follow school regulations?</b>

04:46.500 --> 04:48.540
<b>Talking back right now isn't going to help.</b>

04:51.290 --> 04:53.960
<b>We're banning any Hero Club activities from here on out.</b>

04:54.130 --> 04:57.000
<b>That includes activities outside the school, of course.</b>

04:57.000 --> 04:58.250
<b>What?!</b>

04:58.420 --> 05:04.290
<b>This is for your own good.
You could get expelled if you go too far.</b>

05:07.330 --> 05:09.250
<b>OFF</b>

05:07.330 --> 05:09.250
<b>LIMITS</b>

05:14.630 --> 05:17.380
<b>Enraged... Galaxy...</b>

05:17.380 --> 05:28.080
<b>Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch...</b>

05:20.460 --> 05:22.290
<b>They broke Noda-kun.</b>

05:22.290 --> 05:23.380
<b>He's always like this.</b>

05:24.250 --> 05:25.500
<b>Calm down, Noda.</b>

05:25.500 --> 05:28.080
<b>Giving into rage isn't going to change anything.</b>

05:28.080 --> 05:29.290
<b>Don't try to stop me, Green!</b>

05:29.380 --> 05:33.500
<b>Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch, Punch...?</b>

05:29.540 --> 05:31.210
<b>That anger with no outlet...</b>

05:31.580 --> 05:33.830
<b>Why not express it in a performance?</b>

05:34.080 --> 05:35.750
<b>What do you mean?</b>

05:37.170 --> 05:38.670
<b>Avant-garde!</b>

05:38.920 --> 05:40.290
<b>He just wanted to say that!</b>

05:40.630 --> 05:44.130
<b>I see. So we stick it to the man.</b>

05:44.830 --> 05:45.750
<b>Huh?</b>

05:54.420 --> 05:57.000
<b>This isn't the kind of performance I meant...</b>

05:57.000 --> 05:59.250
<b>Are they going to "stick" that spear
and hair somewhere...?</b>

06:01.000 --> 06:02.420
<b>What's wrong with this?</b>

06:03.290 --> 06:08.500
<b>Hmph. I told you we should go
with my idea of what's best.</b>

06:09.290 --> 06:10.920
<b>Your idea, Purple?</b>

06:13.380 --> 06:14.540
<b>Meow, meow, meow!</b>

06:17.630 --> 06:19.130
<b>You mean like this?</b>

06:19.880 --> 06:21.880
<b>Is that what you think of me...?</b>

06:21.880 --> 06:23.380
<b>Well, cats are cute!</b>

06:24.500 --> 06:27.500
<b>That's right! Take this and cheer up!</b>

06:27.500 --> 06:28.250
<b>Here!</b>

06:30.710 --> 06:31.670
<b>Meow...</b>

06:34.960 --> 06:37.630
<b>A one, two, three, four...</b>

06:42.460 --> 06:43.710
<b>So cold...</b>

06:45.580 --> 06:46.920
<b>I'm going home.</b>

06:47.790 --> 06:50.500
<b>Me too. There's a limited time sale on soon.</b>

06:51.130 --> 06:54.710
<b>Then I shall head home as well,
before my third eye awakens.</b>

06:55.250 --> 06:57.330
<b>H-hold on guys!</b>

06:58.130 --> 07:01.710
<b>The new iLive! song is coming out
online in thirty minutes, you know.</b>

07:02.210 --> 07:03.420
<b>Seriously?!</b>

07:03.830 --> 07:06.040
<b>Sorry, Yamato! See you tomorrow!</b>

07:07.960 --> 07:09.210
<b>Noda-kun...</b>

07:17.000 --> 07:19.130
<b>Mizuki-chan, don't you have your club?</b>

07:19.380 --> 07:23.880
<b>Huh? Not anymore. Because it's been shut down.</b>

07:24.130 --> 07:25.420
<b>Oh... Sorry!</b>

07:25.790 --> 07:31.330
<b>You still all leave right after classes,
so I thought you were getting together somewhere else.</b>

07:31.500 --> 07:32.750
<b>Ah...</b>

07:44.580 --> 07:46.250
<b>All I get are busts.</b>

08:11.170 --> 08:14.380
<b>After all I've been through,
why does emptiness strike me now?</b>

08:23.670 --> 08:26.420
<b>What are you making all the way out here?</b>

08:30.670 --> 08:33.920
<b>With the Hero Club gone, I've kind of lost my motivation.</b>

08:34.290 --> 08:36.670
<b>Maybe because things were so hectic every day.</b>

08:37.040 --> 08:41.710
<b>Everything's so quiet all of a sudden,
and I'm just feeling a bit flat.</b>

08:42.250 --> 08:46.080
<b>I didn't realize how important
it was to have a place to get together.</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:51.210
<b>Don't worry, I'm almost done!</b>

08:52.420 --> 08:53.460
<b>With what?</b>

08:53.460 --> 08:54.960
<b>Our clubroom!</b>

08:55.920 --> 08:57.880
<b>Where'd you get that cloth from?</b>

08:58.290 --> 09:00.630
<b>From a textile store we helped out before!</b>

09:02.040 --> 09:03.210
<b>Here, take these.</b>

09:03.210 --> 09:04.290
<b>Yay!</b>

09:04.830 --> 09:08.040
<b>This is the command center, and this is your seat, Pink!</b>

09:09.080 --> 09:12.710
<b>This is Yellow's seat, and that's Black's!</b>

09:12.710 --> 09:15.290
<b>You seem more okay than I thought.</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:18.250
<b>A hero's gotta overcome obstacles, y'know?</b>

09:18.630 --> 09:24.380
<b>You really never change, even at a time like this.
I... kind of respect that.</b>

09:24.630 --> 09:30.330
<b>Right! Let me help out. I'll go see if there's
anything good where they keep scrap material.</b>

09:30.330 --> 09:31.750
<b>I'm counting on you, Pink!</b>

09:31.750 --> 09:34.500
<b>Right, right. I'm not Pink, though!</b>

09:39.830 --> 09:41.080
<b>Are you okay?!</b>

09:42.000 --> 09:46.790
<b>S-something attacked-! F-from those bushes...!</b>

09:49.750 --> 09:50.960
<b>It's blood...</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:54.080
<b>It's just a flesh wound. Hold it together!</b>

09:54.290 --> 09:57.330
<b>Wha-?! Sekiya-senpai?! What happened?</b>

09:58.750 --> 10:01.130
<b>I've got a bad feeling about this...</b>

10:04.920 --> 10:05.880
<b>What?</b>

10:05.210 --> 10:08.290
<b>Someone stole the net? Oh dear...</b>

10:05.880 --> 10:07.670
<b>Why's it gone?</b>

10:07.670 --> 10:08.670
<b>Huh?</b>

10:10.790 --> 10:12.630
<b>A sacrifice made to emptiness, hmm?</b>

10:12.630 --> 10:14.130
<b>Soccer's canceled!</b>

10:14.420 --> 10:16.170
<b>Home Economics</b>

10:15.630 --> 10:19.670
<b>All right! For today's cooking class,
we'll be using horse mackerel.</b>

10:20.040 --> 10:23.290
<b>Lemon butter fish with a béarnaise sauce, maybe.</b>

10:23.710 --> 10:25.330
<b>Carpaccio's pretty good.</b>

10:25.670 --> 10:28.040
<b>Sora-chan's smiley deep fried mackerel!</b>

10:28.040 --> 10:29.670
<b>I wanna eat them all!</b>

10:29.670 --> 10:33.080
<b>Oh, that's odd. I don't have enough fish.</b>

10:33.330 --> 10:34.830
<b>Did someone pass some out already?</b>

10:36.750 --> 10:42.080
<b>Okay, change of plans. Today, we'll make something
quick with the things we can find in the fridge.</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:43.790
<b>What to make for dinner tonight?</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:43.790
<b>Fish is on sale!</b>

10:41.840 --> 10:43.790
<b>• grilled fish</b>

10:41.840 --> 10:43.790
<b>• stewed with daikon radish</b>

10:45.420 --> 10:48.330
<b>What should I make for dinner?</b>

10:48.330 --> 10:52.880
<b>Quiet down! Unfortunately, the octopus
we were going to use has gone missing.</b>

10:52.880 --> 10:54.630
<b>Maybe someone ate it!</b>

10:56.830 --> 10:58.000
<b>Octopus, huh?</b>

10:58.830 --> 11:00.830
<b>Drama</b>

10:58.830 --> 11:00.830
<b>Club</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.830
<b>rehearsing</b>

11:01.830 --> 11:05.580
<b>We've got a problem, President!
Someone stole our squared timber for the set!</b>

11:05.580 --> 11:07.080
<b>What?!</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:09.420
<b>There were only four of them, but still.</b>

11:09.420 --> 11:13.080
<b>With the budget as tight as it is,
even one thing of wood is a major problem!</b>

11:13.630 --> 11:15.750
<b>Damn whoever did this!</b>

11:16.670 --> 11:18.830
<b>Half the cloth is gone.</b>

11:18.830 --> 11:21.210
<b>The rope's gone, too! Who would do this?!</b>

11:21.380 --> 11:23.250
<b>Maybe a bear's on the loose...?</b>

11:23.250 --> 11:26.580
<b>You can't be serious.
We're right next to the heart of Tokyo!</b>

11:28.130 --> 11:32.040
<b>What's with all the clamor?
I can't focus on my sealing ritual.</b>

11:32.380 --> 11:33.210
<b>Sorry!</b>

11:34.250 --> 11:37.630
<b>Before my right arm starts throbbing, I must make haste and...</b>

11:37.630 --> 11:38.750
<b>What's that?</b>

11:44.080 --> 11:45.080
<b>It's fast!</b>

11:45.880 --> 11:49.040
<b>The only way to catch that thing is to use that spell, but...</b>

11:49.540 --> 11:51.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

11:51.830 --> 11:54.630
<b>Faust! Don't utter that name so easily!</b>

11:54.960 --> 11:57.790
<b>What's that spell?! It sounds super cool!</b>

11:57.790 --> 11:59.750
<b>This isn't the time for that!</b>

12:00.750 --> 12:06.790
<b>What you heard, I can't undo...
This spell is ranked S as the highest form of holy magic,</b>

12:06.960 --> 12:09.330
<b>the forbidden and most powerful ultimate technique.</b>

12:09.630 --> 12:13.210
<b>"The forbidden and most powerful ultimate technique"...!</b>

12:13.210 --> 12:13.750
<b>Shh!</b>

12:14.080 --> 12:16.290
<b>It's not a phrase to be uttered so casually.</b>

12:16.290 --> 12:18.170
<b>That's right, it's-</b>

12:19.000 --> 12:19.750
<b>Is it here?!</b>

12:20.540 --> 12:23.250
<b>Eternal Force Blizzar-!</b>

12:23.250 --> 12:25.630
<b>I told you not to utter those words!</b>

12:26.040 --> 12:27.420
<b>But nothing happened!</b>

12:28.130 --> 12:29.580
<b>It didn't work?!</b>

12:30.630 --> 12:34.000
<b>The enemy's power is stronger than ours...!</b>

12:34.000 --> 12:36.540
<b>I'm kinda getting excited!</b>

12:36.830 --> 12:39.830
<b>Don't... Don't do anything more....</b>

12:39.830 --> 12:41.830
<b>Time to train!</b>

12:41.830 --> 12:44.420
<b>Why does it always have to be like this?!</b>

12:45.920 --> 12:48.080
<b>The police are here.</b>

12:50.580 --> 12:54.920
<b>We finally got rid of the Hero Club,
and now we have a theft problem.</b>

12:55.170 --> 12:57.210
<b>A soccer goal net from the athletic field,</b>

12:57.330 --> 12:59.500
<b>ten horse mackerel from the home economics room,</b>

12:59.670 --> 13:01.830
<b>one octopus from the biology room,</b>

13:01.830 --> 13:05.460
<b>four beams of timber from the Drama Club, and more.</b>

13:05.750 --> 13:08.130
<b>Why would anyone steal those things?</b>

13:08.420 --> 13:13.500
<b>We should report the attack on Sekiya from
the Band Club as well, just in case.</b>

13:14.080 --> 13:15.710
<b>It just never ends.</b>

13:16.790 --> 13:18.830
<b>Student safety is the top priority!</b>

13:19.420 --> 13:20.960
<b>To prevent any more incidents,</b>

13:20.960 --> 13:26.080
<b>we will ask the teachers to cooperate in patrolling
school grounds after classes end!</b>

13:26.540 --> 13:27.420
<b>Right!</b>

13:29.960 --> 13:32.460
<b>Darkness lies</b>

13:29.960 --> 13:32.460
<b>one step ahead.</b>

13:32.830 --> 13:35.000
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys...</b>

13:36.750 --> 13:39.170
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

13:41.880 --> 13:42.920
<b>Did you hear?</b>

13:42.920 --> 13:44.080
<b>About the thief?</b>

13:44.080 --> 13:46.130
<b>No, the thing with the zoo.</b>

13:46.130 --> 13:48.210
<b>The zoo? What's that?</b>

13:48.460 --> 13:50.790
<b>Some zookeeper got totally beat up.</b>

13:50.790 --> 13:52.130
<b>What? Why?</b>

13:52.130 --> 13:54.540
<b>Who knows? The culprit's still on the loose.</b>

13:54.670 --> 13:57.920
<b>Apparently the scene was all bloody and awful.</b>

13:58.420 --> 13:59.630
<b>That's scary...</b>

14:02.080 --> 14:05.040
<b>Who cares about the Student Council anymore?!</b>

14:06.670 --> 14:10.130
<b>The Brass Band needs Nakamura-kun to play piano!</b>

14:11.040 --> 14:14.830
<b>Nakamura-kun's training in the grove out back...</b>

14:15.420 --> 14:16.250
<b>Thanks!</b>

14:18.580 --> 14:23.380
<b>The Home Economics Club needs Tsukumo-kun
and Mikuriya-kun for their skill and expertise!</b>

14:23.670 --> 14:25.040
<b>They've gone home already.</b>

14:25.380 --> 14:26.290
<b><i>Non!</i></b>

14:26.290 --> 14:29.830
<b>Stay with me, Francis! The nurse's office!
To the nurse's office!</b>

14:30.540 --> 14:34.670
<b>Takashima's screentone and shading/highlighting
skills will save our club's deadline!</b>

14:35.000 --> 14:38.750
<b>I think he went off to ride
the Sora-chan themed bus...</b>

14:39.250 --> 14:40.830
<b>Which bus line?!</b>

14:41.170 --> 14:44.040
<b>Wait, there's an event on at J-Karaoke today!</b>

14:44.040 --> 14:45.880
<b>I bet he's on Kamino Main Street!</b>

14:47.710 --> 14:49.330
<b>There's not a moment to lose!</b>

14:50.790 --> 14:52.790
<b>There you are, the Pink girl.</b>

14:53.830 --> 14:55.580
<b>I'm not Pink!</b>

14:55.580 --> 14:56.540
<b>You're not?</b>

14:56.880 --> 14:59.080
<b>We're all from sports clubs.</b>

14:59.420 --> 15:03.170
<b>It honestly really sucks to not have
help from the Hero Club!</b>

15:03.420 --> 15:05.380
<b>But the Student Council...</b>

15:06.880 --> 15:08.420
<b>Can't you do something about that?</b>

15:10.130 --> 15:11.170
<b>Please!</b>

15:12.170 --> 15:13.790
<b>We're really screwed!</b>

15:14.580 --> 15:20.710
<b>Our ace swimmer Sato can't swim because of an injury!
Why'd you have to get injured now, Sato?!</b>

15:21.710 --> 15:25.290
<b>Please! Tell us where Noda is right now!</b>

15:25.830 --> 15:30.170
<b>He said he needs to prepare for when the Earth
might be in peril, and went on a training trip.</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:31.960
<b>No way!</b>

15:32.710 --> 15:35.080
<b>We're done for...</b>

15:35.790 --> 15:39.500
<b>The Student Council banned us from any activities, so...</b>

15:40.130 --> 15:42.750
<b>I'm gonna go give the Student Council
a piece of my mind...</b>

15:42.750 --> 15:44.500
<b>I'll go with you...</b>

15:46.040 --> 15:48.460
<b>Sorry we took up your time.</b>

15:57.830 --> 15:59.210
<b>Oh, it's you!</b>

15:59.460 --> 16:00.420
<b>Uh, huh?</b>

16:00.420 --> 16:03.380
<b>Excuse me, where can I find the Hero Club?</b>

16:03.750 --> 16:06.880
<b>We want them to do a Sora-chan show for our bazaar.</b>

16:07.790 --> 16:11.210
<b>I came to ask the Sora-chan guy for help!</b>

16:11.960 --> 16:14.500
<b>Oh, it's that little girl!</b>

16:17.540 --> 16:23.710
<b>Listen. Sora-chan guy and the others
can't help anyone out anymore.</b>

16:24.000 --> 16:24.750
<b>What?</b>

16:25.540 --> 16:27.500
<b>R-really?!</b>

16:28.130 --> 16:30.790
<b>I'm sorry. Stuff happened...</b>

16:36.210 --> 16:38.710
<b>That girl was so disappointed.</b>

16:38.920 --> 16:40.000
<b>Yeah...</b>

16:40.630 --> 16:42.460
<b>I wish we could have helped her.</b>

16:42.880 --> 16:47.080
<b>Let's do it! I can't be like Noda-kun and them,
but I'll do my best!</b>

16:47.540 --> 16:52.380
<b>Me too! We would've gotten disbanded
if it wasn't for the Hero Club!</b>

16:52.880 --> 16:53.750
<b>But...</b>

16:54.630 --> 16:56.750
<b>Let's just do what we can!</b>

16:56.750 --> 16:58.630
<b>The Drama Club will pitch in, too!</b>

16:59.750 --> 17:03.540
<b>Yeah, you're right. Let's start with what we can!</b>

17:06.830 --> 17:11.170
<b>That's what's going on?! Rei never tells me anything!</b>

17:11.750 --> 17:17.040
<b>How's Tsukumo-kun doing?
We're not in the same class so I never get to see him.</b>

17:17.420 --> 17:19.040
<b>He's doing just fine.</b>

17:19.630 --> 17:23.210
<b>He's making ridiculously elaborate
but creepy bento lunches.</b>

17:24.170 --> 17:25.920
<b>His mental state doesn't seem okay!</b>

17:26.920 --> 17:33.380
<b>The iLive show finished quite a while ago,
but I'll see if I can find the guy who played Sora-chan.</b>

17:33.830 --> 17:37.380
<b>Thank you so much. I'm sorry for the trouble.</b>

17:38.960 --> 17:39.960
<b>Not at all.</b>

17:39.960 --> 17:44.630
<b>You helped me out before. Now we're even.</b>

17:54.250 --> 17:56.250
<b>I hope this works out somehow.</b>

17:56.830 --> 18:03.290
<b>Shimokawa-san and Nanako-chan will make
the Sora-chan costume, so if there's no one else...</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:05.580
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

18:05.830 --> 18:08.460
<b>I'll play the part, for the honor of the Drama Club!</b>

18:09.040 --> 18:10.540
<b>So that's reassuring.</b>

18:12.250 --> 18:13.080
<b>Oh?</b>

18:18.130 --> 18:18.960
<b>Uh?</b>

18:19.580 --> 18:20.710
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:21.000 --> 18:22.540
<b>There he is!</b>

18:22.540 --> 18:23.460
<b>Huh?</b>

18:27.000 --> 18:28.580
<b>Um, I have a favor to ask!</b>

18:28.580 --> 18:30.750
<b>Oh, you're that girl from before.</b>

18:31.130 --> 18:32.380
<b>Well? Have a seat.</b>

18:32.750 --> 18:34.250
<b>Oh, right.</b>

18:36.960 --> 18:42.130
<b>I just got the message. If it's a Sora-chan show you need,
you already have the perfect guy, right?</b>

18:42.500 --> 18:47.000
<b>Oh... No... Takashima-kun can't anymore.</b>

18:48.750 --> 18:50.290
<b>Wait, don't tell me...!</b>

18:51.170 --> 18:53.500
<b>He loved Sora-chan so much, too.</b>

18:54.330 --> 18:55.880
<b>That's awful.</b>

18:56.830 --> 18:57.960
<b>He died?</b>

18:58.580 --> 18:59.250
<b>So...!</b>

18:59.250 --> 19:01.000
<b>You don't have to say the rest.</b>

19:02.330 --> 19:05.580
<b>Of course. It's such a sudden request.</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:08.790
<b>No, that's not it. I'll do it.</b>

19:09.290 --> 19:10.170
<b>Huh?</b>

19:11.170 --> 19:14.830
<b>I'll perform the best Sora-chan ever for the little ones...</b>

19:16.250 --> 19:19.580
<b>if that means he'll rest in peace.</b>

19:20.290 --> 19:23.460
<b>Uh, "rest in peace"? Did Takashima-kun die?!</b>

19:23.460 --> 19:25.040
<b>What? He's alive?!</b>

19:28.290 --> 19:30.420
<b>Thank you for agreeing to help.</b>

19:30.420 --> 19:32.670
<b>Sure. Leave it to me!</b>

19:34.210 --> 19:39.630
<b>Let's go! Just be myself, just "I"</b>

19:39.630 --> 19:43.920
<b>Yes, we want to shine in the now!</b>

19:44.210 --> 19:47.920
<b>Make your smiles shine and
tomorrow will be another happy day!</b>

19:50.960 --> 19:53.710
<b>Thanks for all this. This is for you.</b>

19:55.130 --> 19:56.540
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

19:58.210 --> 20:04.040
<b>We made this mochi from the glutinous rice
that the Hero Club kids helped us plant.</b>

20:04.330 --> 20:06.790
<b>They helped us with these sweet potatoes, too.</b>

20:07.000 --> 20:11.710
<b>They did the things no one usually bothers
to help us with, like changing light bulbs,</b>

20:11.710 --> 20:14.420
<b>and they always seemed happy to help.</b>

20:16.380 --> 20:19.380
<b>Who would've thought they'd get in trouble for that?</b>

20:20.420 --> 20:23.580
<b>Oh! No one here is to blame for that, at all!</b>

20:23.920 --> 20:25.580
<b>It's such a pity.</b>

20:25.580 --> 20:27.630
<b>Maybe we relied on them too much.</b>

20:28.670 --> 20:32.170
<b>I thought those guys just have
a serious case of cringey adolescence,</b>

20:33.380 --> 20:37.630
<b>but I guess people really needed the Hero Club.</b>

20:38.580 --> 20:39.630
<b>Mizuki-chan...</b>

20:46.380 --> 20:49.000
<b>Mizuki-chan, you're one of them, too.</b>

20:51.630 --> 20:55.630
<b>When the thing with Sekiya-senpai happened,
I was really worried,</b>

20:55.880 --> 20:59.750
<b>but having you there was so reassuring, Mizuki-chan.</b>

21:01.040 --> 21:03.460
<b>I didn't know you felt that way.</b>

21:03.670 --> 21:04.460
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:04.460 --> 21:07.750
<b>So there's nothing wrong with helping people.</b>

21:08.080 --> 21:10.130
<b>The club never did anything wrong.</b>

21:10.500 --> 21:14.830
<b>I'll do everything I can to help with
what you want to do, Mizuki-chan!</b>

21:16.130 --> 21:17.460
<b>So don't give up.</b>

21:19.580 --> 21:20.750
<b>You're right.</b>

21:25.040 --> 21:28.670
<b>I'm going to try doing what I can for the Hero Club!</b>

21:28.920 --> 21:30.130
<b>That was great!</b>

21:29.250 --> 21:32.580
<b>If something goes wrong, I'll take full responsibility!</b>

21:30.130 --> 21:30.670
<b>Thanks.</b>

21:38.880 --> 21:40.380
<b>Wait... Huh?!</b>

21:50.420 --> 21:52.250
<b>Wh-what was that?!</b>

22:03.880 --> 22:08.540
<b>Azayaka na melody kisetsu no kaze o matoi</b>

22:08.540 --> 22:11.630
<b>Boku o yonderu</b>

22:11.880 --> 22:19.080
<b>Afuredasu rhythm kutsuoto mo kasoku shite</b>

22:19.500 --> 22:27.330
<b>Utsumuiteru dakeja tsukamenai nanika sagashi ni yukou</b>

22:27.500 --> 22:37.580
<b>Donna takai kabe demo kimi to yukunara kitto toberu sa</b>

22:38.000 --> 22:40.290
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.630 --> 22:44.540
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.540 --> 22:47.750
<b>Egaita sono tsubasa de</b>

22:47.750 --> 22:51.540
<b>Keep flying and to story</b>

22:51.790 --> 22:56.420
<b>Ashita o kakeru kara</b>

22:56.420 --> 23:00.540
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.540 --> 23:03.880
<b>Kienai sono kodou wa</b>

23:03.880 --> 23:07.790
<b>Keep trying and to story</b>

23:07.790 --> 23:11.460
<b>Kasanaru harmony</b>

23:11.630 --> 23:17.250
<b>Dare no mono demonai miraizu wa</b>

23:17.630 --> 23:22.630
<b>Kimi to tsuzutteku</b>

23:26.580 --> 23:27.750
<b>The time has come.</b>

23:27.540 --> 23:30.330
<b>So this is what the world has chosen...</b>

23:27.750 --> 23:30.790
<b>I get it now. This town needs the Hero Club.</b>

23:30.130 --> 23:32.750
<b>When this battle is over...</b>

23:30.790 --> 23:32.250
<b>You were just lonely, right?</b>

23:32.000 --> 23:34.500
<b>Apparently, they think they can take us on...</b>

23:32.170 --> 23:34.880
<b>I can't let him take all the glory!</b>

23:32.330 --> 23:33.540
<b>Are you talking about yourself?</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:36.210
<b>Are you sure? You might not make it back.</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:35.630
<b>Our battle has just begun.</b>

23:32.830 --> 23:35.250
<b>When you get back home give her my message.</b>

23:32.880 --> 23:34.540
<b>We finally made it here!</b>

23:32.960 --> 23:34.880
<b>It's just a flesh wound.</b>

23:32.960 --> 23:34.750
<b>↑ You have to tell her yourself.</b>

23:33.460 --> 23:35.830
<b>I'll take care of this. You guys go on ahead!</b>

23:33.540 --> 23:34.540
<b>Shut it, Futaba.</b>

23:33.540 --> 23:36.040
<b>I can't afford to lose here.</b>

23:33.920 --> 23:35.580
<b>Give them all you've got.</b>

23:34.080 --> 23:36.210
<b>I never really hated you.</b>

23:34.540 --> 23:35.580
<b>Well, I'm sure we'll figure it out.</b>

23:35.750 --> 23:36.750
<b>Right, Yamato?</b>

23:35.960 --> 23:38.750
<b>Let the final battle begin---</b>

23:37.000 --> 23:40.170
<b>Next episode: "Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight"!</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:41.000
<b>Gooooooooooo Forth and Illuminate, Searchliiiiiiiight!</b>

23:37.710 --> 23:40.250
<b>Seaaaaarchliiiiiiiight!! !! !! !! !! !! !! !! !! !!</b>

23:37.790 --> 23:39.790
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!!!!!!!!!!</b>
